### QC & Diagnostic Checks

If you want to polish this into a production-grade 3D-Var workflow, two quick enhancements will lock it down:

#### 1. Innovation-Based Quality Control (Gross Error Check)

Filter out observations prior to $H$ operator application where the innovation exceeds $3 \sigma$:

```python
# Compute raw innovation vector d
d_raw = obs_df["y_obs"].values - H @ x_b
sigma_tot = np.sqrt(sigma_b**2 + sigma_r**2)

# Pass observations that fall within +/- 3 sigma threshold
qc_mask = np.abs(d_raw) <= (3.0 * sigma_tot)
obs_df = obs_df[qc_mask].reset_index(drop=True)

```

